  "description": "University student Min-woo gets a free dog for free after his parents go abroad for business, and he lives alone in a studio.  \nHowever, it was Hwi-jun, a cute elementary school student, who brought the dog 'Dongi', who was supposed to be sold.  \nA different thought grows in Hwi-Jun-i's head, who visits Min-Woo's house every day to see Doongi... !\n\nOriginal Webtoon: [ Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/bigdog_and_littleboy#_=_), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/content/home/09dh10n3813f/viewer/09dh10odd552), [ Mcomics](https://www.mcomics.co.kr/search?artist=%EC%B1%84%EB%8F%84%EC%98%A4)",
